  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given circuit, the breakdown voltage of the Zener diode is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>. What is the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></math> ?</p><img src=\"assets\\qt0046_c2496f282f0e.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 235px;\"/>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": " <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mA</mi></math>",
